Private Household Employees Ordinance (PHEO)
SR 192.126 — Ordinance of 6 June 2011 on Conditions for Entry, Stay and Work for Private Household Employees of Individual Beneficiaries of Privileges, Immunities and Facilities (Private Household Employees Ordinance, PHEO).
